<title>GREECE: Greek OTE shortlists 7 for tele procurement.</title>
<headline>Greek OTE shortlists 7 for tele procurement.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's state-run telecoms company OTE picked seven out of 15 candidate firms to continue in the second round for the procurement of material related to the DCS1800 system, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The seven firms are Alcatel, Intrakom -Ericsson, Lucent Telecommunications-Bell laboratories Innovations, Motorola Inc, Northern Telecom Ltd and Siemens AG, it said.</p>
<p>-- Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
